Package: SSHd
Priority: Optional
Section: Network
Maintainer: Christiane Ruetten
Standards-Version: 0.6.0
Version: 0.1.0-1
Licence: Free
Description: SSH server for RISC OS 5
 A minimal SSH server built on libssh and mbedTLS.  Accepts public-key
 logins and runs *commands through OS_CLI, returning their output over the
 SSH channel.  Configuration lives in Choices:SSHd.
Homepage: https://github.com/cr/riscosshd
Depends:
Components: Apps.Network.!SSHd (Movable)
